{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114233","id":3119701377,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc658t2B","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114233","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114233.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114233.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114233","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114233/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114233/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114233/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c552eca330e611256b1e188cfca09118c858a036","number":114233,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix builds on FreeBSD, OpenBSD, and NetBSD","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I was able to compile from scratch on FreeBSD 15.0 / 13.5, OpenBSD 7.8 / 7.7, and NetBSD 10.1 without disabling anything using this pr.\r\n\r\nI briefly ran the editor on OpenBSD, created a new project, and add a couple nodes in 3D. I currently do not have access to a FreeBSD or NetBSD machine with a display out so I have only briefly tested them in headless mode.\r\n\r\nBasically what I've done when compiling under bsd:\r\n- Use bsd joystick implementation in sdl.\r\n- Disabled haptics.\r\n- Disabled camera module.\r\n- Dont set `HAVE_SECURE_GETENV` for openxr.\r\n- Modify linker flags and fix clang / gcc detection.\r\n- Directly define mouse button codes so that `input-event-codes.h` can be removed because it is not available on NetBSD.\r\n- Replace a few system apis with their bsd counterparts.\r\n- Fix some warnings which become errors when compiling in dev mode.\r\n- Replace some problem instances of `size_t` with `uint64_t` in the wayland implementation instead of adding a `long` constructor to `Variant` due to OpenBSD defining `size_t` as `long`. The two wayland files are the only ones in the project with this problem so it seems overkill to change `Variant` to fix the problem.\r\n\r\nAlso the issue in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101588#issue-2790302628 where the editor would not compile is due to the process memory limit being relatively low in OpenBSD by default (1.5GB for users with the `staff` class). I also had this failure around the same part, but if you raise the limit (e.g. `ulimit -d 10000000`), then you can compile fine.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/55192\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/92130\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110606\r\nSupersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101588","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reas